% n11: the Pow-shaped U of the Hurkens construction, claimed at Sort 0.
% U = Pi (X : Sort 0). ((X -> Sort 0) -> X) -> (X -> Sort 0)
% Kept because it exercises nested pi levels at depth, but NOTE: measured by
% mutation testing, it does NOT discriminate the impredicative rule on its own
% -- n02 is the test that does. Keeping a non-discriminating test and saying so
% is better than keeping it and believing it works.
1 sort 0
2 var 0
3 sort 0
4 pi 2 3
5 var 1
6 pi 4 5
7 var 1
8 sort 0
9 pi 7 8
10 pi 6 9
11 pi 1 10
12 sort 0
check 11 : 12
